Changes to github.com/yzhou216/flake under test, as a diff against
1dd2043, under the terms of that repository:

  afe3a63 commons: ignore the argument of the locale function
  affeb58 commons: merge the definitions of the t3code environment
  a6123a3 commons: move the t3code service into t3code.nix
  96c3063 commons: move the emacs overlays into emacs.nix
  7e8d6b7 commons: drop commented-out settings of the configuration.nix template
  e6eaa59 commons: drop settings that nixos sets by default
  faa01fa commons: drop the networkmanager settings, which nothing enables
  7ce614c commons: move networking, openssh, and tailscale into network.nix

